# RACK: ENV opens it at ENV1 (made the selected envelope), SELECT walks to
# LFO2's page (back two pages), and holding ENV turns LFO2's Rate and Depth
# from ENV1: a chain. KNOB1 alone then turns LFO2's own Rate base. LFO
# steps on to the next LFO, LFO1 (wrapping round); ENV opens ENV1 (the
# envelope last shown) and again steps to ENV2.
--button 0.05:PLAY/STOP
--button 0.10:ENV
--turn 0.20:SELECT:-2
--button 0.30:ENV:0.4
--turn 0.40:KNOB1:25
--turn 0.50:KNOB3:-50
--turn 0.90:KNOB1:-10
--button 1.00:LFO
--button 1.10:ENV
--button 1.20:ENV
